atorProcessor.registerAdditionalBeans()`\r\n\r\n2. rebuild the validator extension\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd extensions/hibernate-validator\r\nmvn clean install -DskipTests\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. run the validator itest\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd integration-tests/hibernate-validator\r\nmvn clean test\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis fails as expected because we are still on maven-surefire-plugin 2.22.1\r\n\r\n4. Upgrade to maven-surefire-plugin 3.0.0-M4 in the top pom.xml\r\n\r\n5. Run the validator test again\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd integration-tests/hibernate-validator\r\nmvn clean test\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected: the test and the whole maven build fails \r\nActual:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[INFO]  T E S T S\r\n[INFO] -------------------------------------------------------\r\n[INFO] Running io.quarkus.it.hibernate.validator.HibernateValidatorFunctionalityTest\r\n[INFO] Tests run: 0, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, Time elapsed: 1.649 s - in io.quarkus.it.hibernate.validator.HibernateValidatorFunctionalityTest\r\n[INFO] \r\n[INFO] Results:\r\n[INFO] \r\n[INFO] Tests run: 0, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\r\n[INFO] \r\n[INFO] ------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n[INFO] BUILD SUCCESS\r\n```\r\n\r\ncc @aloubyansky ","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","recei